# Flow map

When adding or changing a user-facing screen or journey:

1. Register it in `flowMap.ts`, and in `flow-map-screens.json` + `flowScreenImages.ts` if it has a PNG preview.
2. Run `npm run validate-flow-map:fix`.
3. Refresh screenshots from the **flow map** page (**Update** / **Update all**) with `npm run flow-map-capture-server` running, or use `npm run capture-flow-screens`.

Wrap testing-only UI in `<PrototypeOnly>`.

Full checklist: docs/tickets/Standards.md § Flow map
